@NAME@ @VERSION@ - @TARGET@
================================================================

@INTRO@
Saves and settings live outside the program files and survive every
install, update and uninstall:

@DATA_PATHS@

  hdd/      the emulated Xbox hard disk: your save games
  config/   enhance.toml (graphics options) and launch.env (your own
            launcher settings, KEY=value lines, e.g. RECOMP_PB_BACKEND=cpu)
  logs/     one log per launch, the newest @LOG_KEEP@ kept

config/enhance.toml is copied from enhance.toml.default on the first launch
and then left alone. The launcher refreshes config/enhance.toml.default on
every launch, so it always shows the installed version's options: compare
the two to pick up new ones.

